0..62 Comment "//! `reduct` reads an included theory from an extension model."
63..66 Comment "//!"
67..141 Comment "//! `Monoid.Semigroup` forgets the monoid members outside `Semigroup`. The"
142..220 Comment "//! checker applies this reduct when it requires a semigroup. Each theory that"
221..296 Comment "//! a block includes, directly or through another, takes a reduct. A reduct"
297..333 Comment "//! keeps a sort and never seals it."
334..337 Comment "//!"
338..410 Comment "//! `endoManifest` restores its carrier before it restricts its members."
411..414 Comment "//!"
415..431 Comment "//! - see: #1092"
432..448 Comment "//! - see: #2136"
